e82bbe1a3fb1c3305ecdbc40b2ba989643a23298f53200a681297ab55794ab101144103782cbe87b6419a1f0b8599da8a05c721d3643406af35b825f09bddf7a  0001-libflashrom-fix-build-on-big-endian-targets.patch
"
